d:The floor's pages are served through a shared cache, so everyone on shift sees the same copy. The duty editor reviews a board when asked.

<br>

The duty editor is automated. It opens the board you ask it to, stays a few seconds, and leaves. It has no access to the internet, issues GET requests only, and will not reach anything outside this application. There is a limit on how many reviews can be in flight at once.

<br>

